  "rules": [
   "entry: 1h CISD (series_open, 2/2 swings, max_wait 3, min_series 1), decide at the confirming 1h close, enter next M1 open, stop at the protected swing, hold 10h",
   "daily C2 = previous 18:00 NY day; bearish C2: its high > the prior day's high and its close < that high (bullish mirror on lows); bias = C2 direction; a day that is both (outside day closing inside) has no direction and is excluded",
   "book = CISD trades in the bias direction; target = C2 low (bearish) / C2 high (bullish), kept only if beyond P",
   "gate soft_inv = a 1h close of today (closed by the decision) beyond the C2 EQ (H+L)/2 against the bias; claim '-' (less expansion after soft invalidation)"
  ],
